    "Folder commands appear only when the terminal reports a matching folder. You can always find them in the command library." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Folder commands appear only when the terminal reports a matching folder. You can always find them in the command library."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "目录指令仅在终端上报的目录匹配时显示；也可随时从指令库查看。"}}}},
