    "A new shell uses its login environment. Temporary variables and virtual environments from the current terminal are not inherited." : {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "A new shell uses its login environment. Temporary variables and virtual environments from the current terminal are not inherited."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "新终端使用登录环境，不继承当前终端的临时变量和虚拟环境。"}}}},
    "The current terminal is ready. Its input buffer is checked again when you execute." : {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The current terminal is ready. Its input buffer is checked again when you execute."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "当前终端可接收命令，执行时会再次检查输入是否为空。"}}}},
    "The current terminal is busy or its input state is unknown. Use a new terminal." : {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The current terminal is busy or its input state is unknown. Use a new terminal."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "当前终端忙碌或输入状态未知，请在新终端执行。"}}}},
